🚀 FastAPI Tutorial

1. Create a Virtual Environment

It is recommended to use a virtual environment or a Docker container for every FastAPI project.

Create a virtual environment

python -m venv <environment_name>

Example:

python -m venv testenv

Note: The venv module is included with Python 3. If it is unavailable, install virtualenv:

pip install virtualenv

⸻

2. Activate the Virtual Environment

macOS / Linux

source <environment_name>/bin/activate

Example:

source testenv/bin/activate

Windows (Command Prompt)

<environment_name>\Scripts\activate

Windows (PowerShell)

<environment_name>\Scripts\Activate.ps1

⸻

3. Install FastAPI & Uvicorn

After activating the virtual environment, install FastAPI and the Uvicorn ASGI server.

Basic Installation

pip install fastapi uvicorn

Recommended Installation

This installs FastAPI along with additional recommended dependencies.

pip install "fastapi[standard]"

⸻

4. Check Installed Packages

Display all installed Python packages:

pip list

Export installed packages:

pip freeze

Save project dependencies:

pip freeze > requirements.txt

Install dependencies from requirements.txt:

pip install -r requirements.txt

⸻

5. Project Structure

A basic FastAPI project structure:

project/
│
├── app/
│
├── main.py
│
├── requirements.txt
│
└── README.md

⸻

6. Create Your First FastAPI Application

Create a main.py file.

from fastapi import FastAPI
app = FastAPI()
@app.get("/")
async def root():
    return {"message": "Hello, World!"}

⸻

7. Run the Application

Start the server

python -m uvicorn main:app

Start with Auto Reload (Development)

python -m uvicorn main:app --reload

Run on a Custom Port

python -m uvicorn main:app --port 8080 --reload

Run on a Custom Host & Port

python -m uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --reload

⸻

8. Open in Browser

Application

http://127.0.0.1:8000

Swagger UI (Interactive API Documentation)

http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

ReDoc Documentation

http://127.0.0.1:8000/redoc

⸻

9. Stop the Server

Press:

Ctrl + C

to stop the running FastAPI server.

⸻

10. Deactivate the Virtual Environment

When you’re done working, deactivate the virtual environment:

deactivate



